  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.01 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Accountancy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.01 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Accountancy. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.1, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of accountancy under RSA 309-B:\n\nTable 1002.1 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Accountancy\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nCertified public accountant (CPA) license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $201\n\nActive to inactive not in conjunction with renewal | 2 years | $201\n\nReturn to active not in conjunction with renewal | 2 years | $101\n\nCPA firm, domestic or foreign, license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $66\n\nPublic accountant license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $201\n\nActive to inactive not in conjunction with renewal | 2 years | $201\n\nReturn to active not in conjunction with renewal | 2 years | $101\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
